# Data: raw API dumps are never committed (regenerate via collect_precedents.py).
# processed/ and analysis/ ARE committed once real data has been collected
# and validated (see README "실제 데이터 수집 현황") - Render's free tier has
# no persistent disk, so the deployed backend needs these shipped in the repo
# to serve real data immediately after deploy, rather than fake/empty data.
backend/data/raw/*
!backend/data/raw/.gitkeep

